  ($q$cs-210$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Toxicologist A argues that current pesticide residue limits on produce adequately protect consumers, citing safety margins built into regulatory testing.

