  ($q$cs-218$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Immunologist A argues that booster shots should be given at fixed yearly intervals to maintain consistent population-wide immunity.

