  ($q$cs-220$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 1, $q$Text 1: Agricultural scientist A argues that vertical farms will soon outcompete traditional farms for leafy greens, citing their drastically lower water use and year-round growing seasons.

