  ($q$cs-221$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Musicologist A argues that a folk music genre's distinctive rhythm spread through oral tradition passed between traveling musicians at regional festivals.

