  ($q$cs-223$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 1, $q$The cave-diving instructor's briefings were ______, covering every potential hazard in the flooded tunnels before divers were allowed to descend.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["thorough","careless","brief","vague"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Covering 'every potential hazard' before a dive describes a thorough briefing, not a careless or vague one.$q$, null),
