  ($q$cs-238$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 1, $q$Text 1: Nutritionist A argues that intermittent fasting produces greater weight loss than simply cutting calories throughout the day, citing a trial in which fasting participants lost more weight over twelve weeks.

