  ($q$cs-331$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Labor economist A argues that a recent minimum wage increase in a mid-sized city caused measurable job losses in the restaurant sector within six months.

