  ($q$cs-581$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Text Structure and Purpose$q$, 1, $q$Following a long description of the town's beloved farmers' market, the author notes that it will close next year to make way for a parking structure.$q$, $q$Which choice best describes the function of the underlined sentence in the text as a whole?$q$, $q$["It repeats an earlier description of the market's vendors.","It introduces a development that threatens the market the author has just praised.","It offers a humorous aside unrelated to the market.","It provides a definition of the term 'farmers' market.'"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$The final sentence shifts from praise to a threat to the market.$q$, null),
