  ($q$cs-583$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Text Structure and Purpose$q$, 2, $q$The author describes how a small-town bakery's sales rose after it began donating leftover bread to a shelter. She then notes that customers cited the donations as a reason for choosing the bakery over larger chains.$q$, $q$Which choice best states the main purpose of the text?$q$, $q$["To explain how bakeries make bread.","To suggest that community-minded practices can benefit a business.","To criticize the shelter's food program.","To argue that large chains should donate more bread."]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$The text links donations to rising sales and customer loyalty.$q$, null),
