  ($q$cs-661$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 1, $q$The old bridge could not bear the weight of modern trucks, so the city built a new one beside it.$q$, $q$As used in the text, what does the word “bear” most nearly mean?$q$, $q$["produce","tolerate","carry off","support"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$The bridge couldn't hold up the trucks' weight, so "bear" means "support."$q$, null),
