  ($q$cs-664$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Some critics argue that adapting novels into films always diminishes the original work, since films can't capture a character's inner thoughts.

